* (guards against this exit's broad, cross-module scope).
  ASSIGN ('(SAPLQPL1)QALS-CHARG')    TO <lv_charg>.
  CHECK sy-subrc = 0.
  ASSIGN ('(SAPLQPL1)QALS-PRUEFLOS') TO <lv_curlot>.
  CHECK sy-subrc = 0.

* Batch not entered -> nothing to check
  CHECK <lv_charg> IS NOT INITIAL.

* Read the batch currently saved on this lot in the DB.
  SELECT SINGLE charg INTO lv_db_charg
    FROM qals
    WHERE prueflos = <lv_curlot>.

* Only validate if the user actually CHANGED the batch.
* Unchanged batch (rule 2 first part) -> allow, do not check.
  CHECK <lv_charg> NE lv_db_charg.

